  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 tablespoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "4 cups buttermilk",
    "4 eggs",
    "4 tablespoons canola oil",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "1 teaspoon canola oil, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat a cast iron skillet or griddle over medium heat for 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pmGNWcB73l9SKYtx7oWE1iuNOF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278361-buttermilk-pancakes-for-a-crowd-VAT-003-step-01-10feba9a3dfa4c8cb668afe7c06069dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278361/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, sugar, baking powder, baking soda, and salt together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9Sqm6lfDPbFrxiGsOkdnktl4f7E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278361-buttermilk-pancakes-for-a-crowd-VAT-004-step-02-3a4ecc87eb55498591c45cb9954f18a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278361/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix buttermilk, eggs, 4 tablespoons oil, and vanilla extract together in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yGiLFFiMhzzNiFkhPIgTlFjyc4A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278361-buttermilk-pancakes-for-a-crowd-VAT-005-step-03-1d9babe8c98b4dfb8874b1fd3ca550fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278361/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour wet ingredients into dry ingredients and whisk until mixed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wdS2OcTMYkRbGdMB1fggbOpKo00=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278361-buttermilk-pancakes-for-a-crowd-VAT-006-step-04-b2b65d0c60f44796bf216a7ba910885a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278361/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly grease the preheated skillet with 1 teaspoon canola oil. Pour batter into the hot skillet by 1/4 cup for small pancakes, 1/3 cup for medium pancakes, or 1/2 cup for large pancakes. Cook until edges are slightly dry and underside is golden brown, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ky2k_XAijckngy_PJ3u6LfQT61o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278361-buttermilk-pancakes-for-a-crowd-VAT-007-step-05-ae79c23fb305402ea4ebf955fb5c81d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278361/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip and cook until golden brown on second side, about 2 minutes more. Repeat until all batter is cooked. Regrease the skillet as necessary to keep pancakes from sticking.",
